ne Arabic","termine":"حَفْلَة","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"ajp","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from South Levantine Arabic حَفْلَة (ḥafla, “party, celebration”)."},{"parola":"חתיך","pos":"adj|noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"calco","incerta":"no","significato":"handsome, attractive","termine_origine":"شقفة","catena":[{"codice":"ajp","nome":"South Levantine Arabic","termine":"شقفة","categoria":"calco"}],"lontana":"ajp","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Back-formation from חֲתִיכָה (khatikhá, “piece, chunk; an attractive woman”), the latter sense being a calque of South Levantine Arabic شقفة (šaqfa /⁠ˈʃaʔ.fa⁠/, literally “piece”)."},{"parola":"חתיכה","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"calco","incerta":"no","significato":"piece, chunk","termine_origine":"شقفة","catena":[{"codice":"ajp","nome":"South Levantine Arabic","termine":"شقفة","categoria":"calco"}],"lontana":"ajp","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Action noun of חָתַךְ (khatákh, “to cut”). The sense \"attractive woman\" maybe a calque of South Levantine Arabic شقفة (šaqfa /⁠ˈʃaʔ.fa⁠/, literally “piece”). Compare German Stück with the same semantic extension."},{"parola":"כוס אמכ","pos":"intj","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"fucking hell, god dammit, damn you","termine_origine":"كس إمك","catena":[{"codice":"ajp","nome":"South Levantine Arabic","termine":"كس إمك","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"ajp","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From South Levantine Arabic كس إمك (kuss immak, literally “your mother's pussy”). See Egyptian Arabic كس أمك (kuss ummak)."},{"parola":"כיף","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"fun","termine_origine":"كَيْف","catena":[{"codice":"ajp","nome":"South Levantine Arabic","termine":"كَيْف","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"ajp","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From South Levantine Arabic كَيْف (kīf, “enjoyment, joking”)."},{"parola":"לבנה","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":4,"categoria":"prestito"